u encounter notes, bloodstains, and corpses left behind by those who ventured there before you. These notes help you piece together the secrets of a mysterious company called Dimension Technology Lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, you discover that your character is &quot;Subject No. 3.&quot; However, you also come across the chilling truth: only those with subject numbers have survived entering the maze.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;1899: Secrets of the Maze&quot; offers gameplay that challenges both your problem-solving and survival skills. Key mechanics include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Notes:</strong><br>Collect hidden notes throughout the maze to unravel the story and find your way out. These notes reveal the dark plans of Dimension Technology Lab and the secrets of the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/a708426182c75890d30014ab38f0c0f6.poster.avif?t=1751457457\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/a708426182c75890d30014ab38f0c0f6.webm?t=1751457457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/a708426182c75890d30014ab38f0c0f6.mp4?t=1751457457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/96eff6088ee52cf8c4509bcb761bfb9c.poster.avif?t=1751457457\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/96eff6088ee52cf8c4509bcb761bfb9c.webm?t=1751457457\" type=\"video/webm; co