g><br>The game's sound design and visual details are crafted to keep you on edge. Dim lighting, echoing footsteps, and zombie moans create a chilling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/fb49d10a00eb0ebd682c8049ea86b870.poster.avif?t=1751457457\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/fb49d10a00eb0ebd682c8049ea86b870.webm?t=1751457457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/fb49d10a00eb0ebd682c8049ea86b870.mp4?t=1751457457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/52dcc6f7f15b0cba102179b213b84c07.poster.avif?t=1751457457\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/52dcc6f7f15b0cba102179b213b84c07.webm?t=1751457457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429680/extras/52dcc6f7f15b0cba102179b213b84c07.mp4?t=1751457457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Zombie Maze Connection:</strong><br>The game references &quot;Escape Zombie Maze.&quot; Traces of Subject 19's story are hidden in this new adventure, offering a striking surprise for fans of the series.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Atmosphere and Modern Sci-Fi:</strong><br>The gothic elements of 1899 blend seamlessly with science fiction themes, delivering a timeless horror experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story and Choices:</strong><br>Player decisions influence the outcome of the story. Every fork in the maze presents a new threat or reward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;1899: Secrets of the Maze&quot; delivers a unique blend of horror, suspense, and intellect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you uncover the dark secrets of Dimension Technology Lab and survive as Subject 3?</p>",
