        "notes": "My game offers a horror and mystery-themed experience while including some mature content that players may want to be aware of beforehand:\r\n\r\n    Violence and Gore:\r\n        The game features corpses found within the maze, bloody scenes, and dark-themed visuals.\r\n        Encounters with zombies include violent confrontations and death scenes.\r\n        Graphic details of zombies falling into traps depict violence.\r\n\r\n    Psychological Tension:\r\n        The notes discovered in the game include stories of past traumas and hopelessness.\r\n        Horror elements, sudden sound effects, and disturbing environments may trigger feelings of anxiety.\r\n\r\n    Drugs and Experiments:\r\n        The storyline involves uncovering unethical experiments conducted on human subjects by a corporation.\r\n        The effects of these experiments, including mental and physical deterioration of subjects, are narrated through notes.\r\n\r\n    Self-Harm and Despair:\r\n        Some notes and scenes discovered in the maze subtly reference themes of self-harm and despair.\r\n\r\nWARNING: The game does not contain any sexual content, depictions of sexual assault, or alcohol use. However, the themes mentioned above may be sensitive for some players. It is advised that players approach these themes with caution."
    },
